				<p/>
				<p>The main flood peak along the lower Paroo River is now downstream of Hungerford, where the river level fell below the minor flood level overnight Tuesday into Wednesday.</p>

				<p>Further downstream, a Minor Flood Warning remains current for the Paroo River (NSW).</p>

